{"id":"2b8fcf92581114e5","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-arithmetization.md","title":"Arithmetization","display":"df-arithmetization — Arithmetization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-arithmetization","aliases":["92-df-arithmetization"],"display":"df-arithmetization — Arithmetization","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-expression]]","[[92-df-signature]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 30–36（PDF 47–53）","source_status":"本地编码像构造；与对象语言表达区分"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-arithmetization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-arithmetization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetization — Arithmetization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 30–36（PDF 47–53）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地编码像构造；与对象语言表达区分"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (code-set constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\\)</span> (syntactic-object class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Arith}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Arith}_G\\)</span> (definition-target arithmetization operator)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization} \\vdash \\mathrm{Arith}_G:\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G))\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N),\\qquad \\mathrm{Arith}_G(X)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization} \\vdash \\mathrm{Arith}_G:\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G))\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N),\\qquad \\mathrm{Arith}_G(X)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Arith}_G(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Arith}_G(X)\\)</span> : 语法对象类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的 Gödel 码像</li>\n<li>算术化：将语法对象编码为算术对象</li>\n<li>本定义只给出外部集合论层面的编码像；它本身尚未证明该像可在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 内定义或表示</li>\n<li>要让 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>“谈论”自身语法，还需证明相关编码关系是原始递归，并调用可表示性定理</li>\n<li>这些附加性质才构成自引用论证的技术基础</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书从具体句法条件递次构造算术公式，最终得 PE/RE 的算术性。本文只生成外部码像；具体原书系统的可表达性已由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c056f7fa0375bc62\" href=\"?note=c056f7fa0375bc62\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization\">92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization</a> 给出，不能对任意 X 自动成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-expression]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Code}_G$ (code-set constructor, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)$ (syntactic-object class, see [[92-df-expression]], [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)$ (syntactic-object class, see [[92-df-expression]], [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization","status":"resolved","id":"c056f7fa0375bc62","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书从具体句法条件递次构造算术公式，最终得 PE/RE 的算术性。本文只生成外部码像；具体原书系统的可表达性已由 [[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]] 给出，不能对任意 X 自动成立。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Arith}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization} \\vdash \\mathrm{Arith}_G:\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G))\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N),\\qquad \\mathrm{Arith}_G(X)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Arith}_G(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1670,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization]]"}],"outgoing":["2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","c56ec2b54fc34fc6","d666a3e3ee6c8148","c056f7fa0375bc62"]}